{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】粵艇南下首航儀式今日(10月16日)在大嶼山遊艇會舉行，署理財政司司長黃偉綸、運輸及物流局局長陳美寶將主持儀式。另外，消防處舉行記者會將介紹重陽節防山火及科技應用的部署。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.904469+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T23:48:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:59.695476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:44.121493+00:00","content_hash":"8f829311779dce4f1856e2c4a8bf9e76628b44b547d868fb7e0625f7bef0b21e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}